{
  "category": "Armor Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "It has sharp, hard tusks and a rugged hide. Its TACKLE is strong enough to knock down a house.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "The longer and bigger its tusks, the higher its rank in its herd. The tusks take long to grow.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "Because this POKéMON's skin is so tough, a normal attack won't even leave a scratch on it.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "DONPHAN’s favorite attack is curling its body into a ball, then charging at its foe while rolling at high speed. Once it starts rolling, this POKéMON can’t stop very easily.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "If DONPHAN were to tackle with its hard body, even a house could be destroyed. Using its massive strength, the POKéMON helps clear rock and mud slides that block mountain trails.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "A DONPHAN is so strong it can easily haul a dump truck. Its hide has toughened to a rock-hard state. An ordinary sort of attack won’t even leave a scratch.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
